      "content": "Those are good archetypes. To make it feel really authentic and \"street,\" I want to get more specific with their backgrounds. Like, tell me about their ethnicities or cultural vibes. Since they're part of the city's underworld, I want them to feel like they belong to specific communities that actually live in those high-tension areas. Give me some details on what those characters might look like and where they're coming from to make the contrast with my lead even stronger.",
